    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree BFS (levels)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-tree-zigzag-level-order-traversal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 103</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Binary Tree Zigzag Level Order Traversal</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Do a normal level-order BFS and never change how children are queued; only change where each value is written: slot i on even levels, slot width-1-i on odd levels. O(n) time, O(width) extra space, no reversing.</p>\n"
